CONTEXT
    Use private absolute gh, acli, and adf executables under <storage>/tools/bin;
    storage defaults to <user-home>/.inux. Honor an explicit storage override and
    use .exe on Windows. Outside setup, report missing tools without installing,
    logging in, or probing versions. For Jira network calls, request host-approved
    outside-sandbox execution on the first attempt; in Cursor Shell include
    required_permissions: ["all"]. Stop if unavailable or denied. Process errors
    and uncertain writes stop dependent work. Inspect remote state before retrying
    an uncertain publication. Use Git directly with the selected absolute project.
AS tool_guidance
